ada@grumpy.mnfep.nn.inri.com (Anthony D Alston) writes:

>I got three unicorn's horns and two worm's teeth.
>How do I use them?
>What do you do with the worm's teeth?

You can wield them both. They are weapons. The worm tooth isn't a very
good weapon, though. If you enchant the worm tooth, it will become a
crysknife, which IS a very good weapon. When you drop it, it will
become a worm tooth again. Have a look below (the +++ means a bonus +3
to hit, I added the long sword for comparison). The file that this
table comes from can be ftp-ed from ftp.krl.caltech.edu as
/pub/nethack/weaponry.

Weapon                Wt   Sdam  Ldam   Avg Dmg   Metal
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~  ~~  ~~~~~ ~~~~~~  ~~~~~~~~  ~~~~~~
long sword            40     d8    d12  4.5/6.5   IRON
crysknife (+++)       20    d10    d10  5.5/5.5   MINERAL
unicorn horn          20    d12    d12  6.5/6.5   BONE
worm tooth            20     d2     d2  1.5/1.5   ????

Also, you can apply the unicorn horn, which figures, since it is a
tool. This will (if the horn isn't cursed) cure your diseases, like
blindness, sickness (which is otherwise lethal), confusion,
hallucination, etc. Also, when applied, it will restore any damaged
stats.

